[00:00.00]Good morning, beautiful sea!|早上好，美丽的大海！
[00:04.82]Let's build a sandcastle.|我们来堆沙堡吧。
[00:08.34]Yes, Grandma!|好呀，奶奶！
[00:10.56]First, let's dig the sand.|先挖沙子。
[00:14.10]Use my little shovel.|用我的小铲子。
[00:16.36]Dig, dig.|挖呀挖。
[00:18.04]Fill the bucket with sand.|把桶装满沙子。
[00:20.56]The bucket is full.|桶满了。
[00:22.76]Good. Now pat the sand.|很好。现在把沙子拍实。
[00:24.84]Pat, pat, pat it flat|拍呀拍，把它拍平。
[00:30.60]Ready? Let's lift it up|准备好了吗？我们把它提起来。
[00:33.32]One, two, three|一、二、三——
[00:37.80]Wow! A beautiful castle!|哇！一座漂亮的城堡！
[00:41.82]I found some shells|我找到一些贝壳。
[00:43.68]Put them on the sand castle|把它们放在沙堡上。
[00:45.96]It is so pretty|真好看。
[00:51.54]Oh, the wave is coming!|哦，浪来了！
[00:57.40]Look, a little crab!|你看，一只小螃蟹！
[01:00.42]Hello, little crab!|你好呀，小螃蟹！
[01:02.92]Time for coconut juice!|该喝椰子汁啦！
[01:06.30]Yummy! I love the sea!|真好喝！我爱大海！
[01:10.04]We can play again tomorrow.|我们明天还可以再来玩。
